## Analyst run complete — sipgate

**Delta:** Found the public `api.sipgate.com/v2/swagger.json` (144 paths) + `/v2` root index, fully mapping the REST API (voicemails, SMS, CDR history, portings, balance, contacts, crm-bridge). Confirmed live the `ImplicitAuthenticator`/`TokenAuthenticator` code and the prefix/range `redirect_uri` validation under `app.sipgate.com` (off-origin rejected — hardened).

**Key hypotheses (this cycle):**
- **[IDOR/BOLA, conf 40, AUTH_HELPED]** — Cross-tenant access on `/{userId}/...`, `/voicemails/{voicemailId}`, `/history/{entryId}`, `/portings/{portingId}`, `/groups/{groupId}`. Global object IDs + per-user paths, all OAuth-scoped but no documented tenant-binding. This is the highest-value non-REJECTED lead; needs a valid test token.
- **[OATH, conf 45, HUMAN_ONLY]** — Unvalidated client `redirect` on `implicit-auth-redirect`; token stored to localStorage before nav, so statically same-origin-only; needs browser to resolve.
- **[AUTH, conf 30, AUTH_HELPED]** — Privileged `internal`-scope `/app/users` (full user directory) scope-confusion check.

**Probes run (read-only, ≤1rps):** GET `swagger.json`, `/v2` index, redirect_uri variant checks, OIDC discovery, SPA JS inspection.

**Risk:** 38 — broad OAuth-scoped API is classic BOLA surface but not shown vulnerable without a token; the unvalidated redirect is real code but statically no token exfil. No confirmed live vuln this passive cycle.

